# Cross-Org Migration Scope — environment template.
#
# The solution itself requires no secrets: both agents ship with builtin
# tools only. Add entries here as you connect real tooling to the
# installed agents — e.g. a GitHub App integration on the Researcher
# (and optionally the Orchestrator, read-only) for the shared
# paper-test repo. The GitHub App binding covers hosted and local
# astrorun sessions alike (bind it to the agent with an
# enablement/github_app installation and start a fresh session); a
# local `gh` login with access to the paper-test repo is only needed
# as a fallback on astrorun machines without that binding.
